Reading:
  mod14 wins because the LRC band has a hard 2*7 boundary.  The important
  proof fact is not the win itself; it is that chi_7 and affine_pair retain
  nontrivial signal before the mod14 scalar quotient.  That is the exact
  layer where the HYP-2632 signed-current kernel lives.

